        question: "What is the principal purpose of grouping parts into families during cellular manufacturing design?",
        options: ["To identify parts with similar manufacturing requirements that can be processed through related machine groups", "To increase unnecessary transportation", "To eliminate all employees", "To determine financial accounting standards"],
